This project includes no third-party assets at release time.

When third-party assets are added (art, sound, fonts), they will be listed here
with their licenses and source URLs. Maintain the principle: prefer CC0 / public
domain, otherwise SPDX-compatible permissive licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD).
Avoid GPL-family licenses to preserve the MIT distribution compatibility.

Procedural audio: generated at runtime via the WebAudio API. No audio assets.
Pixel art (future): target CC0 sources such as Kenney.nl or OpenGameArt.org CC0.
Fonts (future): target OFL-licensed fonts (e.g. Google Fonts OFL subset).